'''Ancient Egg: N108''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 40 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

