==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Teal Egg: N108''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Soap Cat''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit#Behemoth Stones|Behemoth Stones]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal/Evolved Form'''===
These forms are <u>useless by design</u>. Similarly to the other [[:Category:Ancient Eggs|Ancient Eggs]], this unit is not meant to be used before its True Form. However, due to its somewhat low cost and quick recharge, it may be used as an emergency meatshield in [[Underground Labyrinth]] or [[Legend Quest]] if you have no use for its True Form.

==='''True Form'''===
Soap Cat is an excellent [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] tanker, with high HP and anti-Alien abilities, such as resistant and weaken against alien, essentially making it an anti-Alien [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]]. With a high movement speed of 25, it can quickly reach the frontlines and serve as an efficient tanker for aliens. At level 30 with all fruit treasures, its effective HP reaches '''297,500 HP''', and against Weakened Aliens this shoots up to '''595,000 HP!'''

Soap also has Behemoth Slayer, which improves its matchups against Alien Behemoths, making it a far superior alternative to [[Ancient Egg: N102 (Rare Cat)|Catarzan]] and [[Ancient Egg: N105 (Rare Cat)|Racquet Cat]]. [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] in particular can be walled for quite a while, as Soap is Immune to its Slow. The same could be said for [[Suidae Piggicus]] and [[Xenobeast Bunaglios]] to some extent. At level 50 with all fruit treasures, it has an insane effective '''787,500 HP''' against Alien Behemoths and, considering no Alien Behemoths are Immune to Weaken, it can potentially reach a whopping '''1,575,000 HP!'''

Soap Cat unfortunately has the disadvantages of being quite expensive, and having a vulnerability to [[Warp]], which can quickly go south for you if Soap Cat doesn't make it back to the frontline in time even with its fast speed, so it must be paired with other anti-Alien specialists like [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]], who can curse most of the problematic warping aliens, or [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], who competes with its greater disposability and Warp Immunity. Speaking of Catellite, Soap cannot fully supersede it, as it is a Super Rare unit that <u>'''cannot be used in 4-crown stages.'''</u>

